OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk southwest winds. Rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with best of limited brighter
OL,7,Fspells expected during the early to
OL,8,Fmid-morning. Some patchy rain about,
OL,9,Fthis focused in Argyll.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FWindy and cloudy. Rain
OL,12,Fextending from Argyll across the whole
OL,13,Farea during the evening, perhaps
OL,14,Fturning heavy at times and to snow
OL,15,Fover Argyll hills overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,18,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,19,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,20,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,21,Flater outbreaks focused over the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
