OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers occasionally reaching Argyll.
OL,7,FCentral Belt southwards seeing a band
OL,8,Fof rain and hill snow reaching from
OL,9,Fthe south Tuesday, otherwise frosty
OL,10,Fstarts, then dry with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
